4,"Bidayuh, Tringgus-Sembaan Language (TRX) – L1 ... - Ethnologue",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/trx/,Tringgus-Sembaan Bidayuh is a stable indigenous language of Malaysia. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Bidayuh, Tringgus-Sembaan",Austronesian
